Dear list,

It has become increasingly clear that I am a bottle neck for the
development of mlmmj. In the project's best interest, I have passed on
the maintainer token.

Please welcome the new maintainer: Ben Schmidt.

Ben will be leading the project from now on. He will continue the
original style of the project -- a simple, easy to manage, easy to
develop, mailing list manager.

Please support him, and keep testing new releases, translating
listtexts, and sumbitting patches.

Happy Hacking,
